                 mutated only via deploy.  Per-tool approval policy
                 IS org-editable, so the dialog opens for system
                 agents too — but in a "selection locked, approvals
                 editable" mode (see ``readOnlySelection`` on
                 McpToolSelector).  Same Edit button, same dialog,
